        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the boundless skies with your little plane! Fly through clouds and obstacles, feeling the wind whipping through your wings—but remember, your true enemy isn't just the obstacles ahead; it's the roaring tornado behind you. It's closing in on you, and all you can do is accelerate, dodge, and persevere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is one: fly over 100 kilometers and claim that untouchable medal of honor. This is not only a test of skill, but also a test of will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, pure challenge: every move determines how far you can fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—Are you ready for this marathon in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943750/extras/21c76b17e64f1e4f3fdde1dcd3eeac16.avif?t=1785578816\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⌨️</strong> Keyboard Controls: ↑ ↓ ← → <strong>/</strong> <strong>WSAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: <strong>Spacebar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: <strong>ESC key</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮</strong> Gamepad Controls: Left Stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: Y</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the boundless skies with your little plane! Fly through clouds and obstacles, feeling the wind whipping through your wings—but remember, your true enemy isn't just the obstacles ahead; it's the roaring tornado behind you. It's closing in on you, and all you can do is accelerate, dodge, and persevere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is one: fly over 100 kilometers and claim that untouchable medal of honor. This is not only a test of skill, but also a test of will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, pure challenge: every move determines how far you can fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—Are you ready for this marathon in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943750/extras/21c76b17e64f1e4f3fdde1dcd3eeac16.avif?t=1785578816\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⌨️</strong> Keyboard Controls: ↑ ↓ ← → <strong>/</strong> <strong>WSAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: <strong>Spacebar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: <strong>ESC key</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮</strong> Gamepad Controls: Left Stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: Y</p>",
        "short_description": "This is an easy-to-learn yet incredibly challenging endless flight game. Control your little plane through the ever-changing sky, nimbly avoiding obstacles and desperately trying to escape the ever-approaching tornado behind you. Every advance is a test of skill and perseverance.",
